    "Title": "Ask HN: What has been bothering you lately?",
    "Url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48567958",
    "Description": "Vent out. Maybe one of us will find a fix.\u003Cp\u003EI\u0026#x27;m mad that economic policies in France aren\u0026#x27;t based on what models say is best next action but on elections. Democracy really sucks.\u003Cp\u003EI\u0026#x27;m also very annoyed that models are censoring stuff without even clarifying what\u0026#x27;s wrong with the prompt.\u003Cp\u003EI don\u0026#x27;t like that content distribution is still mostly owned by a few platforms. Something is deeply odd with that.",
